  "title": "Gorgeous and hazy pixel art horror farming sim Neverway has been pushed to 2027, but you can at least have a gander at some of the NPCs you can smooch",
  "content": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/neverway-key-art.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>\nSorry folks, some bad news: <a href=\"https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/games/neverway\">Neverway</a>, the horror life sim and RPG combo from one of the artists behind Celeste and the composer of <a href=\"https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/games/fez\">Fez</a>, has been delayed into 2027. While it never had an exact release date anyway, developer Coldblood Inc. shared word of the delay in a Steam blog post earlier this week.\n</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/gorgeous-and-hazy-pixel-art-horror-farming-sim-neverway-has-been-pushed-to-2027-but-you-can-at-least-have-a-gander-at-some-of-the-npcs-you-can-smooch\">Read more</a></p>",
